id: pm-gh1428
title: Installed-agent acceptance must recover infeasible context budgets and retain structured refusal diagnostics
description: "GitHub #1428 and Release run 37878238415 reproduced published 2026.10.9 exit 2 at npm:orient. The verifier requests context --limit 1 --token-budget 512, ignores structured stdout on nonzero exit, and unit stubs return an empty object for context. Preserve the complete-envelope SDK contract. Drive real installed context with feasible success budgets, intentionally prove budget refusal and same-intent recovery, validate population facts after mutations, and retain safe bounded diagnostics."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: acceptance,"area:release","horizon:current",regression
