completed_at: "2026-10-09T11:59:26.160Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "Real npm local/global and Bun candidate/control sessions complete the SDK-backed lifecycle under whole-envelope budgets; refusal and same-intent recovery preserve population facts and do not accept omitted output as an empty tracker; nonzero command errors retain redacted bounded stdout and stderr plus process status; regression controls fail before the fix without weakening output limits, artifact identity, deadlines, or release advertisement gates"
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: high
resolution: "Installed-agent acceptance validates whole-envelope context refusals, executes the advertised same-intent unbounded recovery, proves actual empty/closed populations, records exit statuses and retains bounded credential-redacted stdout/stderr diagnostics."
expected_result: Actual installed public SDK/CLI lifecycle succeeds for npm and Bun without omitted context facts or relaxed output ceilings.
actual_result: "Candidate 2026.10.9 and control 2026.10.8 passed four disposable npm/Bun sessions of 13 steps and 23821 characters each; global npm control/candidate passed. Malformed refusal/population and stdout-only failure regressions pass; full source suite 9958 passed at exact 100/100/100/100. Source static assurance, context, packed consumers, linked test and mutation gates pass. Hosted exact-tag recovery remains a separate post-merge observation."
