  "2026-10-09T11:06:19.124Z","harness:codex","Real registry manual acceptance passed with @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.10.9 candidate and 2026.10.8 previous control under npm and Bun in independent disposable workspaces: four sessions, 13 observed steps each, two budget refusals followed by successful same-intent recovery each, complete SDK list item_count=1 and source_complete/full_projection=true. Every session reported 23821 output characters. Platform matrix remains a distinct hosted requirement."
  "2026-10-09T11:25:21.214Z","harness:codex","Strict recurrence gate refused the newly recorded acceptance recurrence because its installed-consumer component had no explicit family seed. Added the canonical acceptance item to the existing installed-consumer family, with its real control-closure regression and full hosted coverage; retained historical class counts and all denominators. Extracted context acceptance validation from the enclosing session to satisfy the separate CodeFactor-compatible complexity limit of 16."
  "2026-10-09T11:31:18.809Z","harness:codex","Cross-project intake: strict all-status corpus and live metadata/history preserve historical completed work. All 18 open GitHub issues have PM-link comments; initial open PR, Dependabot, code-scanning and secret-scanning counts were zero. Full graph audit retained 14911 deduplicated edges, 14844 informative, no ordering contradiction or isolated active item; historical hierarchy advisories and 170 missing-resolution warnings remain visible. Fresh required Sentry/telemetry gate passes with no critical/high Sentry findings, and one-day telemetry reports 4830 finishes, 0.87% failures and zero missing error-code rows. These are current observations, separate from hosted release success and permanent queue drainage."
  "2026-10-09T11:40:53.424Z","harness:codex","Full final-source coverage passed 9958 tests with zero uncovered source counts: lines 64101/64101, statements 67275/67275, functions 13870/13870, branches 51487/51487. All owner-linked tests passed through pm test with isolated schema context. Final candidate/control npm and Bun manual sessions each passed 13 steps with real population, complete SDK read, observed refusal/recovery status and original output ceilings. The earlier full run failed a host npm-module resolution prerequisite and remains a failed receipt; enabling the installed global npm module resolved it without changing source or tests. Final static/context/packed consumer chain is running and closure awaits its result."
  "2026-10-09T11:52:46.985Z","harness:codex","Graph admission: installed-context acceptance and the temporary-path ratchet are co-delivered verification repairs. The completed exact-tag recovery lineage is relevant to accepting its unchanged public package. These are semantic sibling links, not new ordering prerequisites."
  "2026-10-09T12:10:29.521Z","harness:codex","Final pre-PR aggregate validation passed: fresh complete pnpm quality:static, typecheck, source exact coverage, context/token surface, doc/skill links, tracked-file secret scan, dependency audit, all linked checks, npm/npx/Bun/bunx packed consumers and 89-command package-first dogfood. Latest npm pm-changelog 2026.10.5 generated the four actual closures under Unreleased; its check passed. Final distribution 19952672 bytes is below the unchanged 20000000-byte base budget. Historical 170 missing-resolution warnings and known prose gaps remain explicit. All four implemented owners are closed/released; the separately reproduced schema-field transport owner stays open/unclaimed. Hosted review and exact-tag publication recovery remain separate upcoming verifications."
